===Pokémon Adventures===
Dana debuted in ''[[PS582|Pinsir Glares]]''. At the shore of [[Kiloude City]], the Battle Chatelaines found an unconscious {{adv|Blaine}}, who was injured after being sent flying by the [[ultimate weapon]]'s blast. They took Blaine to the [[Battle Maison]] and allowed him to rest and recuperate there. Later, in ''[[PS587|Malamar Traps]]'', Dana and her sisters saw a recovered Blaine off.
